---
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<section class="why-section section-pad"><div class="section-shell why-layout"><div class="section-heading reveal"><p class="eyebrow">07 — A HANDS-ON PARTNER</p><h2>From idea to production<span class="accent-dot">.</span></h2><p class="heading-note">Habib AI Labs is founder-led by {site.founder.name}, an AI and full-stack engineer. You work directly with the person building your system.</p><div class="why-points"><p><span>↗</span> Full-stack engineering, not just prompts</p><p><span>↗</span> Custom systems instead of generic templates</p><p><span>↗</span> Real deployed AI projects to explore</p><p><span>↗</span> Thoughtful testing, guardrails, and handoff</p></div></div><div class="pipeline-card reveal"><div class="pipeline-top"><span class="eyebrow">END-TO-END OWNERSHIP</span><span class="pipeline-code">HAL / BUILD 01</span></div><div class='pipeline-flow'>{site.pipeline.map((item, index) => <div class='pipeline-node'><span class='pipeline-step'>{String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span><span>{item}</span></div>)}</div><div class="pipeline-bottom"><span class="live-dot"></span> Business context at every step</div></div></div></section>

